#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:5
#: 58fb9194dfbf47749f2412cb32ee31e8
msgid "Using SITL with legacy versions of Gazebo"
msgstr "将 SITL 与旧版本的 Gazebo 配合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:7
#: 4773f975ea174200aa1909ecedd1c4c9
msgid ""
"This article explains how to use legacy versions of Gazebo "
"https://classic.gazebosim.org/ as an external simulator for ArduPilot Rover,"
" Copter and Plane."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何将旧版 Gazebo（https://classic.gazebosim.org/）用作 ArduPilot Rover、Copter 和 "
"Plane 的外部仿真器。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:12
#: c07f22608f554c1ba23799e2314aab91
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:14
#: c5748932700444158a5103c42441511b
msgid ""
"Gazebo is a well-known and respected robotics simulator, and is also the "
"official DARPA Virtual Robotics Simulator. No current release has built-in "
"support for ArduPilot,  however. (Previous PRs for built-in support were not"
" merged as of April-2017)."
msgstr ""
"Gazebo 是一款知名且受人尊重的机器人仿真器，也是 DARPA 官方虚拟机器人仿真器。然而，目前没有任何正式版本内置对 ArduPilot "
"的支持（截至 2017 年 4 月，内置支持的 PR 尚未被合并）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:19
#: fbaaed335b0b43deb086e7440beb8d81
msgid ""
"If you find that some of these instructions are outdated, please open an "
"issue for the ardupilot_wiki repository on github."
msgstr "如果发现这些说明已过时，请在 GitHub 上为 ardupilot_wiki 仓库提交问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:23
#: 1dd017a45daa4b42816c39ad5224aabd
msgid ""
"Gazebo is particularly useful for defining autonomous indoor flights or "
"swarms."
msgstr "Gazebo 特别适用于定义自主室内飞行或集群任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:28
#: 767b69eb4608498bbb0af2d7e6230dee
msgid "Preconditions"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:30
#: 2aa5ad4dba5744749d77888e3b66d45d
msgid ""
"We recommend Ubuntu starting from 16.04 or 18.04 as those were  the platform"
" used for testing this approach. They are also known to be compatible with "
"SITL."
msgstr "推荐使用 Ubuntu 16.04 或 18.04，这些是测试此方法使用的平台，也已知与 SITL 兼容。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:32
#: b03eadbeca6848adaedd3edd94a2b9d5
msgid ""
"We will be using a standard version of ArduPilot but a custom plugin for "
"Gazebo, until the gazebo plugin gets merged into Gazebo-master."
msgstr "在 Gazebo 插件合并到 Gazebo-master 之前，我们将使用标准版 ArduPilot 和 Gazebo 的自定义插件。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:34
#: 7c14dfde979e4fe7bf8db4af68c31bbd
msgid ""
"This plugin can be used with or without ROS integration. In both case we "
"recommend to use Gazebo from the OSRF repository."
msgstr "此插件可与 ROS 集成或不集成使用。两种情况下我们都建议使用 OSRF 仓库中的 Gazebo。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:42
#: 0a4b499a2b54452e8c783e26b4f99c9c
msgid ""
"The plugin we will be using works with gazebo versions 7 to 9. We recommend "
"gazebo9 as the new development will append on this version. It isn't "
"available for older versions of  Ubuntu though, so you may need to use an "
"earlier version depending on your system."
msgstr ""
"我们将使用的插件适用于 Gazebo 7 至 9 版本。推荐使用 gazebo9，因为新的开发将在此版本上进行。但旧版 Ubuntu "
"不提供此版本，因此您可能需要根据您的系统使用较早版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:50
#: bf5f46400d984ff2bf78fcd0238ae184
msgid ""
"The first time gazebo is executed requires the download of some models and "
"it could take some time, so please be patient. Let's give a try."
msgstr "首次执行 Gazebo 需要下载一些模型，可能需要一些时间，请耐心等待。让我们试试。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:56
#: f8b118d7ddd24a35b1d0666a5e8ca0f4
msgid "It should open an empty world."
msgstr "它应该打开一个空的世界。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:59
#: cef9750cbbe34c12bc0c69beaf17607d
msgid "Plugin installation"
msgstr "插件安装"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:61
#: ae8c90e2d8d24d16bace3a580a6498d0
msgid ""
"The following plugin is a pure Gazebo plugin, so ROS is not needed to use "
"it. You can still use ROS with Gazebo with normal gazebo-ros packages. We "
"have  two version of the plugin : khancyr and SwiftGust one's. The one from "
"`khancyr <https://github.com/khancyr/ardupilot_gazebo>`__ is the original "
"one. It is stable and only has necessary file to work. The one from "
"`SwiftGust <https://github.com/SwiftGust/ardupilot_gazebo>`__  has more "
"examples and a little bit more documentation. Both use the same plugin, they"
" only differ in the documentation and examples they provide."
msgstr ""
"以下插件是纯 Gazebo 插件，无需 ROS 即可使用。您仍然可以使用普通的 gazebo-ros 包将 ROS 与 Gazebo "
"配合使用。我们有两个版本的插件：khancyr 版和 SwiftGust 版。来自 `khancyr "
"<https://github.com/khancyr/ardupilot_gazebo>`__ 的是原始版本，稳定且只包含必要的工作文件。来自 "
"`SwiftGust <https://github.com/SwiftGust/ardupilot_gazebo>`__ "
"的版本有更多示例和稍多的文档。两者使用相同的插件，区别仅在于文档和示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:67
#: f4ae2075b3864525862bc2f0a7dc8230
msgid ""
"We will be using khancyr plugin for the following explanation. First clone "
"it somewhere in your home directory. (If you need help with git, please see "
":ref:`installed git <git-install>`, :ref:`forked <git-fork>` and "
":ref:`cloned <git-clone>`.)"
msgstr ""
"以下说明将使用 khancyr 插件。首先将其克隆到主目录的某个位置。（如需 git 帮助，请参阅 :ref:`安装 git <git-"
"install>`、:ref:`fork <git-fork>` 和 :ref:`克隆 <git-clone>`。）"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:80
#: 88134b1d12e74292b2b21a40536f990d
msgid ""
"These instructions will clone the repository  into the ardupilot_gazebo "
"directory, and create a new build directory within it. The plugin will then "
"be  compiled and installed  in the Gazebo plugin directory."
msgstr ""
"这些说明将把仓库克隆到 ardupilot_gazebo 目录，并在其中创建新的 build 目录。然后插件将被编译并安装到 Gazebo 插件目录中。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:83
#: 5ce6353e7d494d55a76c53d492265854
msgid "Start the Simulator"
msgstr "启动仿真器"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:85
#: ab479038b74a4035b8decec41fafe4b7
msgid "In a terminal window start Gazebo:"
msgstr "在终端窗口中启动 Gazebo："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:92
#: d70c45201d5e4be1a06d1c2591c8f35e
msgid ""
"In another terminal window, enter the ArduCopter directory and start the "
"SITL simulation:"
msgstr "在另一个终端窗口中，进入 ArduCopter 目录并启动 SITL 仿真："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:99
#: d699752e3bcc47b995bfca6f81f3d8de
msgid "If all works well, you should see this:"
msgstr "如果一切正常，您应该看到以下内容："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo-legacy.rst:107
#: 3d930708c24d4f3c9d5743d4fab8300b
msgid ""
"ROS is commonly used together with Gazebo, but this is out of the scope of "
"this article. If you are using ROS, some packages to consider using are: - "
"*mavros* (for sending and receiving MAVLink packets) - *ros_gazebo_camera* "
"(for publishing Gazebo's virtual camera stream to a ROS topic)"
msgstr ""
"ROS 通常与 Gazebo 一起使用，但这超出了本文的范围。如果您正在使用 ROS，可以考虑使用以下软件包：- *mavros*（用于发送和接收 "
"MAVLink 数据包）- *ros_gazebo_camera*（用于将 Gazebo 的虚拟摄像头流发布到 ROS 话题）。"
